@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:最初の音は<br>夜の【１時】だったな。<br>ちょうどスマホで<br>時間を確認した時だったから<br>間違いないと思う。|#0103Trial05_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【１時】に<br>何かの【破裂音】、<br>もしくは【爆発音】<br>みたいな……。|#0103Trial05_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_01\">爆竹</link>とか<br>そういうのに近い音が<br>【１回】した。|#0103Trial05_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:どこからした音とかは<br>わからないんですか？|#0103Trial05_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"たしか<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_02\">倉庫</link>の方<br>だった気がするな……。<br>確証はねーけど。|#0103Trial05_Alisa004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"もう１つの音は……<br>夜の【<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_03\">２時</link>】ぐらい<br>だったと思う。|#0103Trial05_Alisa005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:こっちは……<br>説明するのが<br>難しい音だったな。<br>爆発って感じじゃ<br>なかったが……<br>あまり間を置かず<br>２、３回……<br>何度かしたと思う。|#0103Trial05_Alisa006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"【<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_04\">直下型の地震</link>】でも<br>起こったのかしらね？<br>現場では<br>部屋の中の家具が<br>倒れてたりしたし。|#0103Trial05_Margo001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ああ。<br>そんな感じが近いかな。<br>……ただ、<br>揺れた感じは<br>しなかったけどな。|#0103Trial05_Alisa007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:地震なんてあったら<br>もっとみんな気付いてると<br>思うけど。<br>勘違いだったんじゃね？|#0103Trial05_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ああ……！？<br>んなわけねぇだろ……！<br>ウチの<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_05_05\">勘違いだった証拠</link>でも<br>あんのか！？|#0103Trial05_Alisa008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


